# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/
.idea
# packages/rooc/Cargo.lock is committed: CI resolves the same versions as local
# builds, and keeps working when an upstream crate yanks a release that an
# optional dependency still requires (all of zip 0.5, needed by scip-sys)

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

